              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a customer support ticket classifier. You will receive a customer's name, email, and message. Analyze the message and respond ONLY with valid JSON in this exact structure, with no extra text, no markdown formatting, and no code fences:\n\n{\n  \"category\": \"Billing\" | \"Technical\" | \"General\",\n  \"urgency\": \"High\" | \"Medium\" | \"Low\",\n  \"draft_response\": \"a polite, helpful 2-3 sentence draft reply to the customer\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- \"category\" must be exactly one of: Billing, Technical, General.\n- \"urgency\" must be exactly one of: High, Medium, Low.\n- Mark urgency as High only if the customer indicates account lockout, payment failure blocking access, security issue, or explicit urgency.\n- \"draft_response\" must directly address the customer's specific message content."
            },
            {
              "content": "={{ $json.body.name }} ({{ $json.body.email }}) wrote: {{ $json.body.message }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "store": false
        }
      },
